  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e5d9f1182fc3e41e8a2ae214deeea00d, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Abysses.Level.PuzzleObjective
  ShowTopMostFoldoutHeaderGroup: 1
  floor: 1
  quadrant: 0
  label: "Code frapp\xE9 par ORANGE"
  labelEnglish: Code knocked by ORANGE
  hints:
  - "Ton pupitre d'\xE9coute, au-dessus de la plaque FRAPPER, affiche le rythme que
    ton partenaire doit frapper sur la cloison."
  - "D\xE9cris-lui le rythme (\xAB 3 coups, pause, 1 coup\u2026 \xBB) : il frappe
    de son c\xF4t\xE9, ton pupitre affiche ce qui est re\xE7u."
  - "Chiffre = nombre de coups rapides ; marquez une petite pause entre les groupes,
    puis attendez 2 secondes \xE0 la fin."
  hintsEnglish:
  - Your listening panel, above the KNOCK plate, shows the rhythm your partner must
    knock on the bulkhead.
  - "Describe the rhythm (\u201C3 knocks, pause, 1 knock\u2026\u201D): they knock
    on their side, your panel shows what was received."
  - Digit = number of quick knocks; leave a short pause between groups, then wait
    2 seconds at the end.
